{"unit_id":"Dogtiti__dsh-input-history#card-zh","repo":"Dogtiti/dsh-input-history","commit":"0624c9459fd48f23fa4deb5a1bc5a83a23db3cb8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-input-history 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的输入历史插件。在会话输入框中按上方向键，可从最近一条开始逐条回看已发送的用户消息；按下方向键可向较新的消息移动，并在越过末条时恢复开始浏览前的草稿。它将入口注册到 conversation.composer.dock 插槽，由 Host 路由读取当前会话日志，过滤运行时注入内容并合并相邻重复消息。适合经常重复编辑提示词、需要找回旧输入的 DSH 用户。无需额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:104-161","index.js:31-96","client.js:177-190"]}
{"unit_id":"Dogtiti__dsh-input-history#card-en","repo":"Dogtiti/dsh-input-history","commit":"0624c9459fd48f23fa4deb5a1bc5a83a23db3cb8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-input-history adds prompt recall to the DSH web composer. ArrowUp in an empty composer shows earlier user messages; ArrowDown moves forward and restores the draft. A Host route filters injected content, merges adjacent duplicates, and bounds cached history. No extra account or API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:104-161","index.js:31-96","client.js:177-190"]}
